  "log": [
    {
      "choice": "You wanted to know if he'd still be there if you weren't lucky. If anyone would.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "scene": "cold_open",
      "t": 1791910181429
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"His sister made me a bracelet.\" Show her. You haven't taken it off.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "scene": "a1_friday",
      "t": 1791910232015
    },
    {
      "choice": "Add one. Type: *8. She knows about this list.* Then put it back.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "scene": "a1_list",
      "t": 1791910289332
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"What are you doing this weekend?\" Ask him a normal question. Be a normal person.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "roll": {
        "dice": [
          6,
          2
        ],
        "kind": "move",
        "label": "Be normal at him",
        "nudged": true,
        "rewound": false,
        "tier": "strong"
      },
      "scene": "a1_hall",
      "t": 1791910325035
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"That's just how they are, Mother. They mean it.\"",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "scene": "a1_mother",
      "t": 1791910393177
    },
    {
      "choice": "Ride Mercutio. He's boarded at Ravenscourt now. He bit Callum once. You love him.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "hub": true,
      "scene": "a1_hub",
      "t": 1791910410072
    },
    {
      "choice": "Take the wall, and at the last second, let go of the reins. Just to see.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "scene": "a1_horse",
      "t": 1791910417742
    },
    {
      "choice": "Callum's walking the grounds alone. Go walk with him.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "hub": true,
      "scene": "a1_hub",
      "t": 1791910448432
    },
    {
      "choice": "\"A friend's little sister made it.\" True. Every word.",
      "ep": "s01e06",
      "scene": "a1_callum",
      "t": 1791910462770
    },
    {
      "choice": "Play it properly. Read Hugh. Count the odds. Make the right bet.",
